The vendored sources have been MODIFIED by the reactive-sqlite-ts
authors: restyled to this project's conventions, reduced to the
surface this library uses, and corrected for two defects present
upstream (a use-after-close segmentation fault, and a bind failure
on negative zero).

The result row readers diverge further than restyling, so they are
disclosed separately: in this build they are plain loops, they
generate no JavaScript source at run time, and they read result
columns whose names contain quotation marks or newlines correctly.
Those are statements about this build, measured here. None of them
is a claim about the upstream sources, which are no longer in this
tree to measure.
